Note: =====================================================================
Note: from_abc.flow — Phase 39 ABC import chapter
Note: =====================================================================
Note:
Note: Composer imports a short ABC tune (4 bars, C major) via (abc str).
Note: The returned Section can be inspected, transformed, or fed into the
Note: rendering pipeline alongside Flow-native Sequences.
Note:
Note: ABC 2.1 subset + abc2midi extensions supported per D-39-15:
Note:   X: index, T: title, M: meter, L: unit note length, K: key, Q: tempo
Note:   notes A-G (octave 4), a-g (octave 5), ' octave up, , octave down
Note:   accidentals ^/_/= sharp/flat/natural (^^ ___ double)
Note:   modal keys Edor/Dmix/Aphr/Cmix/Glyd/Bphr/Floc
Note:
Note: Charitable per D-39-17 / D-v1.5-05 — malformed input never throws;
Note: unknown ornaments dropped with [abc] stderr advisory.
Note:
Note: Run:
Note:   dotnet run --project flow-interpreter examples/notation/from_abc.flow

use "@notation-io"
use "@std"

String tune = "X:1
T:C Major Scale
M:4/4
L:1/4
K:Cmaj
C D E F | G A B c |"

Section parsed = (abc tune)
(print "ABC imported: 1 Section parsed")
